  "body": "All the logging functions currently allow the use of formatting specifiers, with the exception of assert. To avoid confusion for web developers, the assert function should work with formatting specifiers.\n\n``` javascript\nconsole.assert(false, 'string: %s', 'test');\n//-> Assertion failed: string: test\n```\n",
